WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.670
Google just published

00:00:01.482 --> 00:00:02.743
its Cogentic research

00:00:02.555 --> 00:00:03.286
papers

00:00:03.822 --> 00:00:05.036
Google Research has

00:00:04.848 --> 00:00:05.862
just published the

00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:07.147
new Cogentic papers

00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:07.748
in a public

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.527
repository

00:00:08.681 --> 00:00:10.543
covering integer factorization

00:00:10.603 --> 00:00:12.005
discrete logarithms

00:00:11.864 --> 00:00:13.255
and more besides

00:00:13.774 --> 00:00:14.670
Among them are

00:00:14.482 --> 00:00:15.743
papers on nearly

00:00:15.555 --> 00:00:17.170
tight prophet inequalities

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:18.667
for subadditive combinatorial

00:00:18.479 --> 00:00:19.151
auctions

00:00:19.258 --> 00:00:20.377
on fictitious play

00:00:20.189 --> 00:00:21.816
convergence and more

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:23.418
The papers live

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.916
in individual subdirectories

00:00:24.728 --> 00:00:25.517
of the open

00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:27.050
Google Research repository

00:00:27.192 --> 00:00:28.489
which notes plainly

00:00:28.442 --> 00:00:29.150
that this is

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:30.093
not an official

00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:30.989
Google product

00:00:31.518 --> 00:00:32.532
Full story on

00:00:32.343 --> 00:00:33.239
the dashboard
